      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹13.10 (vs ₹10.82 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹13.10 (up from ₹10.82 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹10.0b (up 53% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹450.1m (up 21% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 4.5% (down from 5.7% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 80% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 106% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
